      "text": "Four DUIs, a hit-and-run, and previously removed from the country…\n\nThat’s the criminal record agents were looking at when El Centro Sector’s Targeting Unit zeroed in on a Mexican national in Indio. As he stepped out of his residence, agents executed a warrant for his arrest, taking the repeat offender into custody.\n\nHe had previously been removed in 2022. In 2025, he was released, after a detainer was ignored.\n\nThis time, he didn’t slip away from the #PremierSector.\n\n#DHS #CBP #BorderPatrol #ElCentroSector",
      "text_resolved": "Four DUIs, a hit-and-run, and previously removed from the country…\n\nThat’s the criminal record agents were looking at when El Centro Sector’s Targeting Unit zeroed in on a Mexican national in Indio. As he stepped out of his residence, agents executed a warrant for his arrest, taking the repeat offender into custody.\n\nHe had previously been removed in 2022. In 2025, he was released, after a detainer was ignored.\n\nThis time, he didn’t slip away from the #PremierSector.\n\n#DHS #CBP #BorderPatrol #ElCentroSector",
