      "text": "After years of steady hooves and loyal service, one of our own is hanging up the saddle.  Blaze, a trusted member of the U.S. Border Patrol Horse Patrol, is officially retiring after faithfully serving alongside our agents across some of the toughest terrain along the border. Through long patrols and countless miles, Blaze carried the mission forward with strength, patience, and heart.  Today, we thank Blaze for the years of dedication and partnership he gave to the agents who rode with him.  Enjoy the pasture, old friend. You’ve earned it.🐎\n #CBP #BorderPatrol #PremierSector #ElCentroSector",
